---
// Define props from Astro
const { title, subTitle } = Astro.props;


// Define TypeScript interface for prop
---

<section
  class="mx-auto max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14 2xl:max-w-full" id="cartas-servicios"
>
  <!-- Title and description -->
  <div class="mx-auto mb-6 w-full space-y-1 text-center sm:w-1/2 lg:w-1/3">
    <h2
      class="text-2xl leading-tight font-bold text-balance text-neutral-800 sm:text-3xl dark:text-neutral-200"
    >
      {title}
    </h2>
    {
      subTitle && (
        <p class="leading-tight text-pretty text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
          {subTitle}
        </p>
      )
    }
  </div>
  <div
    class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-y-2 sm:flex-row sm:gap-x-12 sm:gap-y-0 lg:gap-x-24"
  >
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div
        class="flex-col place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 p-5 dark:bg-[#262626] hover:scale-101 transition-all"
      >
        <h3 class="text-3xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50">Empresas</h3>
        <hr
          class="my-0.5 h-px w-48 rounded-sm border-0 bg-gray-100 md:my-10 dark:bg-neutral-50"
        />
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="50"
          height="50"
          viewBox="0 0 48 48"
          class="mb-5 text-black dark:text-white"
          ><g
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="4"
            ><path d="m21 13l-10 7v24"></path><path
              fill="currentColor"
              fill-rule="evenodd"
              d="m21 4l10 7v13l7 5v15H21z"
              clip-rule="evenodd"></path><path d="M4 44h40"></path></g
          ></svg
        >
        <p
          class="w-2/3 text-center text-lg text-balance text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50"
        >
          Todos los servicios corporativos que necesitas, en una sola firma
          global.
        </p>
        <div class="my-10">
          <a
            href="/inicio/servicios-empresariales/"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-[#ba8d34] px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#cca964] text-white"
          >
            Ver más
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex-col place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 p-5 dark:bg-[#262626] hover:scale-101 transition-all"
      >
        <h3 class="text-3xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50">
          Profesionales
        </h3>
        <hr
          class="my-0.5 h-px w-48 rounded-sm border-0 bg-gray-100 md:my-10 dark:bg-neutral-50"
        />
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="50"
          height="50"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          class="mb-5 text-black dark:text-white"
          ><path
            fill="currentColor"
            d="M13 16h-2c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1H3.01v4c0 1.1.9 2 2 2H19c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-4h-7c0 .55-.45 1-1 1m7-9h-4c0-2.21-1.79-4-4-4S8 4.79 8 7H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v3c0 1.11.89 2 2 2h6v-1c0-.55.45-1 1-1h2c.55 0 1 .45 1 1v1h6c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V9c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2M10 7c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2H9.99z"
          ></path></svg
        >
        <p
          class="w-2/3 text-center text-lg text-balance text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50"
        >
        Obtén el respaldo que necesitas para complementar tus servicios profesionales.
        </p>
        <div class="my-10">
          <a
            href="/inicio/servicios-profesionales/"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-[#ba8d34] px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#cca964] text-white"
          >
            Ver más
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex-col place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-neutral-50 p-5 dark:bg-[#262626] hover:scale-101 transition-all"
      >
        <h3 class="text-3xl text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50">
          Familias e Individuos
        </h3>
        <hr
          class="my-0.5 h-px w-48 rounded-sm border-0 bg-gray-100 md:my-10 dark:bg-neutral-50"
        />
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="48"
          height="48"
          viewBox="0 0 48 48"
          class="mb-5 text-black dark:text-white"
          ><g
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-width="4"
            ><path
              d="M10 19s-5.143 2-6 9m34-9s5.143 2 6 9m-26-9s4.8 1.167 6 7m6-7s-4.8 1.167-6 7m-4 8s-4.2.75-6 6m14-6s4.2.75 6 6"
            ></path><circle
              cx="24"
              cy="31"
              r="5"
              fill="currentColor"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></circle><circle
              cx="34"
              cy="14"
              r="6"
              fill="currentColor"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></circle><circle
              cx="14"
              cy="14"
              r="6"
              fill="currentColor"
              stroke-linejoin="round"></circle></g
          ></svg
        >
        <p
          class="w-2/3 text-center text-lg text-balance text-neutral-950 dark:text-neutral-50"
        >
        Su patrimonio y el de su familia, en manos expertas para su protección y crecimiento.
        </p>
        <div class="my-10">
          <a
            href="/inicio/servicios-familiares-individuos"
            class="rounded-2xl bg-[#ba8d34] px-4 py-3 hover:bg-[#cca964] text-white"
          >
            Ver más
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
